1. gen_gr3_input.py:

This code will generate albedo, diffmax, diffmin, watertype, windrot_geo2proj, manning's roguhness file in .gr3 format; currently set as constant values. Requires hgrid.gr3 as an input.
usage: python gen_gr3_input.py

2. gen_bctides.py:

a. To generate bctides.in for Ike Shinnecock regression test:

python gen_bctides.py ../../data/hgrid.ll 2008-08-23 20 \
    --bc_mode tidal \
    --bc_type 3 \
    --constituents Q1,O1,P1,K1,N2,M2,S2,K2,Mm,Mf,M4,MN4,MS4,2N2,S1 \
    --database tpxo \
    --cutoff_depth 40 \
    --earth_tidal_potential Y


b. To generate bctides.in and elev2D.th.nc for Duck, NC regression test:


python gen_bctides.py ../../data/hgrid.ll 2012-10-27 2.333 \
    --bc_mode time-elev \
    --bc_type 4 \
    --elev_th elev.th \
    --vgrid vgrid.in


3. gen_bnd.py

Generates time series of water surface elevations elev2D.th.nc file based on Hycom. Not used in existing RT test.   
usage: python gen_bnd.py



